  "root_cause": "Primary: 2022 tree OOF for QB/RB/WR collapsed to near-constant predictions (WR LightGBM unique=1, std=0; CatBoost ~2 unique values). TE did not collapse, so TE still beat baselines. Secondary: causal meta-ridge on short history overweight XGB (QB coef_xgb\u22481.0, intercept\u2248-7.8) and kept a TFT drag layer (MAE~7.8\u201313), amplifying the collapse. Retrain on current feature_matrix reproduces healthy WR-2022 variance (std~3.6, MAE~5.4); Aug-6 OOF was a train-time artifact.",
